(5507940, 795208, 103032, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot/image.  From an amateur''s viewpoint (me), this image inspires me...  I like the desaturation of the image except for the subject couple.  Great technique in long exposure to convey that the "rest of the world is moving on" but "time is standing still for the love birds."  Composition and technique is right on to create the concept that the couple are in their own little world...at least that''s what I get from it.  Has to be a top ten...</td>', 'Awesome shot/image.  From an amateur''s viewpoint (me), this image inspires me...  I like the desaturation of the image except for the subject couple.  Great technique in long exposure to convey that the "rest of the world is moving on" but "time is standing still for the love birds."  Composition and technique is right on to create the concept that the couple are in their own little world...at least that''s what I get from it.  Has to be a top ten...', '2009-06-01 08:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
