(5508248, 795193, 60495, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes and shadows, the shots textures and lines really lead you into the frame and around the bend which I is great. I do think I may have liked it better without the person stepping into the shot but still a very nice image.</td>', 'I like the shapes and shadows, the shots textures and lines really lead you into the frame and around the bend which I is great. I do think I may have liked it better without the person stepping into the shot but still a very nice image.', '2009-06-01 12:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
