(5508274, 790371, 60495, '<td valign="top">I love the scene but the sun is a little overpowering, capturing this shot with the sun a little lower would have made this a great shot. I especially like the foggy look and the way the image has distinct layers. Nicely seen and framed.</td>', 'I love the scene but the sun is a little overpowering, capturing this shot with the sun a little lower would have made this a great shot. I especially like the foggy look and the way the image has distinct layers. Nicely seen and framed.', '2009-06-01 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
