(5508368, 792687, 103032, '<td valign="top">It''s picturesque, but it looks overly processed and over saturated.  It seems to have a lot of noise too.  I think if it wasn''t as processed (maybe that caused the noise?), it may have worked better.  The picture and composition is nice though.</td>', 'It''s picturesque, but it looks overly processed and over saturated.  It seems to have a lot of noise too.  I think if it wasn''t as processed (maybe that caused the noise?), it may have worked better.  The picture and composition is nice though.', '2009-06-01 13:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508376, 795506, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, it has nice DOF.  However, the front grave stone should have been more in focus.  The out of focus front grave stone and flag will probably bring down your score, otherwise this was a nice composition, nice shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the shot, it has nice DOF.  However, the front grave stone should have been more in focus.  The out of focus front grave stone and flag will probably bring down your score, otherwise this was a nice composition, nice shot.  Good luck.', '2009-06-01 13:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508381, 795452, 103032, '<td valign="top">Its a nice shot showing motion.  The car is nice and crisp.  I think it would have worked better if you had composed the car going into the frame, as opposed to driving out of the frame.  just my opinion though.</td>', 'Its a nice shot showing motion.  The car is nice and crisp.  I think it would have worked better if you had composed the car going into the frame, as opposed to driving out of the frame.  just my opinion though.', '2009-06-01 13:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508384, 794792, 101678, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot here</td>', 'Gorgeous shot here', '2009-06-01 14:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508386, 795166, 103032, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice capture of the bird in flight, but it''s too "centered".  It seems to have a bit of noise too.</td>', 'It''s a nice capture of the bird in flight, but it''s too "centered".  It seems to have a bit of noise too.', '2009-06-01 14:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508399, 794193, 103032, '<td valign="top">I don''t rate based on titles, but I don''t think your title works.  If the bike was in a "cooler" setting maybe, but on the top of a parking structure...?  A different title would have been better or a different setting. IMHO.</td>', 'I don''t rate based on titles, but I don''t think your title works.  If the bike was in a "cooler" setting maybe, but on the top of a parking structure...?  A different title would have been better or a different setting. IMHO.', '2009-06-01 14:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508410, 795476, 103032, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t for the title, I wouldn''t have figured out the person was a bride.  From this viewer''s perspective, it seems like your concept is the bride in "deep thought"...?  But the composition doesn''t focus on her.  Yes, the stairs lead to her, but she is such a small part of the image.  The image/composition doesn''t seem to work in what you are trying to convey.  Just my honest critique.</td>', 'If it wasn''t for the title, I wouldn''t have figured out the person was a bride.  From this viewer''s perspective, it seems like your concept is the bride in "deep thought"...?  But the composition doesn''t focus on her.  Yes, the stairs lead to her, but she is such a small part of the image.  The image/composition doesn''t seem to work in what you are trying to convey.  Just my honest critique.', '2009-06-01 14:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508421, 793773, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours - nicely caught.</td>', 'Lovely colours - nicely caught.', '2009-06-01 14:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508428, 790371, 8860, '<td valign="top">A classic DPC postcard this. WIll score highly for sure. Great time of day and sense of tranquility.</td>', 'A classic DPC postcard this. WIll score highly for sure. Great time of day and sense of tranquility.', '2009-06-01 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508435, 795531, 8860, '<td valign="top">Amazing. That you can capture this is just that. And the subject is wonderful too. A little more depth in the blacks would be just great here but it''s still lovely.<br/> <br/>At least, I assume this is space and not an horrendous case of hot pixels?!</td>', 'Amazing. That you can capture this is just that. And the subject is wonderful too. A little more depth in the blacks would be just great here but it''s still lovely. At least, I assume this is space and not an horrendous case of hot pixels?!', '2009-06-01 14:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508439, 793068, 101678, '<td valign="top">Absolutely exquisite</td>', 'Absolutely exquisite', '2009-06-01 14:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508443, 795197, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry of the lines in this shot.  However, the lighting is "off balance" if you will.  The right side is a bit over exposed.  Also a detractor is the crop; the symmetry is the draw to the image, but the image is tilted slightly toward the left.  I think the tilt caused the curved lines to not meet in the top corners.  The arch is cut off on the left side.  For me, this was almost a perfect shot/study in symmetry.</td>', 'I like the symmetry of the lines in this shot.  However, the lighting is "off balance" if you will.  The right side is a bit over exposed.  Also a detractor is the crop; the symmetry is the draw to the image, but the image is tilted slightly toward the left.  I think the tilt caused the curved lines to not meet in the top corners.  The arch is cut off on the left side.  For me, this was almost a perfect shot/study in symmetry.', '2009-06-01 14:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508448, 794253, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  I think it would have been better to shift the crop to the right a little.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  I think it would have been better to shift the crop to the right a little.', '2009-06-01 14:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508452, 795023, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sweeet.  It''s like he''s saying "yeah, dude, ok, take your picture and leave me alone. "  hahaha 7</td>', 'Sweeet.  It''s like he''s saying "yeah, dude, ok, take your picture and leave me alone. "  hahaha 7', '2009-06-01 14:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508453, 794970, 15711, '<td valign="top">A myriad of rainbow colors!!</td>', 'A myriad of rainbow colors!!', '2009-06-01 14:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508455, 795140, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but too centered.  I think these shots are more "pleasing" to the eye when you use the rule of thirds and to have the subject/bird fly into the frame instead of being centered.  The bird is nice and crisp, nicely focused, nice spread of the wings.</td>', 'Nice capture, but too centered.  I think these shots are more "pleasing" to the eye when you use the rule of thirds and to have the subject/bird fly into the frame instead of being centered.  The bird is nice and crisp, nicely focused, nice spread of the wings.', '2009-06-01 14:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508459, 791207, 15711, '<td valign="top">AWWWWWWW</td>', 'AWWWWWWW', '2009-06-01 14:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508465, 792347, 103032, '<td valign="top">I initially thought you had inverted the image.  Interesting perspective to use the reflection, which happens to be pretty crisp, to be the main focal point.  Cool shot.</td>', 'I initially thought you had inverted the image.  Interesting perspective to use the reflection, which happens to be pretty crisp, to be the main focal point.  Cool shot.', '2009-06-01 14:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508471, 795016, 15711, '<td valign="top">Didn''t we see this in another challenge?<br/> <br/>Still adorable.</td>', 'Didn''t we see this in another challenge? Still adorable.', '2009-06-01 14:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508474, 794849, 103032, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big flower person, but this image caught my eye with your framing technique of defocusing the outside of the frame.  This is nicely done.  Flower is nicely focused inside the frame and the colors are wonderful.  Nice work.</td>', 'I''m not a big flower person, but this image caught my eye with your framing technique of defocusing the outside of the frame.  This is nicely done.  Flower is nicely focused inside the frame and the colors are wonderful.  Nice work.', '2009-06-01 14:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508485, 795090, 62357, '<td valign="top">This one popped up first in my voting today.  Given that I was standing right with you when you took it, I will not vote and will move on.  I do like this one though and hope it''s scoring well. :)</td>', 'This one popped up first in my voting today.  Given that I was standing right with you when you took it, I will not vote and will move on.  I do like this one though and hope it''s scoring well. :)', '2009-06-01 14:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508496, 794539, 62357, '<td valign="top">Still think it looks like the inner workings of a watch.  Hoping it''s going up!</td>', 'Still think it looks like the inner workings of a watch.  Hoping it''s going up!', '2009-06-01 15:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508499, 794401, 62357, '<td valign="top">Andi, I''m at a total loss to figure out why this is not scoring higher.  I do hope and expect it to pull up.  It''s a great shot.</td>', 'Andi, I''m at a total loss to figure out why this is not scoring higher.  I do hope and expect it to pull up.  It''s a great shot.', '2009-06-01 15:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508503, 795059, 77543, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot spoilt by a "loose" crop.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot spoilt by a "loose" crop.', '2009-06-01 15:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508559, 794928, 62357, '<td valign="top">I quite like the high key overexposed look of the image, but I''m afraid the border really takes away from the image.</td>', 'I quite like the high key overexposed look of the image, but I''m afraid the border really takes away from the image.', '2009-06-01 15:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
