(5509364, 794896, 57460, '<td valign="top">The sun peaking over the horizon is beautiful.  The water is very smooth and the colors are wonderful.  The concrete on the left is a little distracting but I understand how it couldn''t be cropped out if out if you wanted to keep the setting sun.  Good shot!</td>', 'The sun peaking over the horizon is beautiful.  The water is very smooth and the colors are wonderful.  The concrete on the left is a little distracting but I understand how it couldn''t be cropped out if out if you wanted to keep the setting sun.  Good shot!', '2009-06-02 00:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509366, 795047, 57460, '<td valign="top">Wow - how fun!  It appears to be a tunnel but I would love to know what lights are causing the beautiful colors.  I love the motion and how it draws the eye into the tunnel.  Very artistic and unique photo.  Great job!</td>', 'Wow - how fun!  It appears to be a tunnel but I would love to know what lights are causing the beautiful colors.  I love the motion and how it draws the eye into the tunnel.  Very artistic and unique photo.  Great job!', '2009-06-02 00:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509374, 792836, 57460, '<td valign="top">Cute shot - he has a very intriguing look on his face.  The background is nicely blurred but the brown color (not sure exactly what it is) can be a little distracting from the little guy since his coat is similar color.  Also, his fur is well focused, but it may have been better if his face was more in focus, in particular his eye.  Great nature candid!</td>', 'Cute shot - he has a very intriguing look on his face.  The background is nicely blurred but the brown color (not sure exactly what it is) can be a little distracting from the little guy since his coat is similar color.  Also, his fur is well focused, but it may have been better if his face was more in focus, in particular his eye.  Great nature candid!', '2009-06-02 00:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509380, 791207, 57460, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!  I love the exposure and gray tones on the hippos.  Great use of DOF.  There is something very serene about this photo.  The OOF object in the front is a little distracting from the main subject though.  i wonder how this would look with the object cropped out.  Great photo either way!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!  I love the exposure and gray tones on the hippos.  Great use of DOF.  There is something very serene about this photo.  The OOF object in the front is a little distracting from the main subject though.  i wonder how this would look with the object cropped out.  Great photo either way!', '2009-06-02 00:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509384, 795649, 57460, '<td valign="top">Stunning and precious.  It makes me think of longing - she looks like she is looking out the window yearning for something - with the single tear down her face.  She is a precious subject and there is a lot of emotion in the photo.  Great job!</td>', 'Stunning and precious.  It makes me think of longing - she looks like she is looking out the window yearning for something - with the single tear down her face.  She is a precious subject and there is a lot of emotion in the photo.  Great job!', '2009-06-02 00:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509389, 794672, 57460, '<td valign="top">Very cute - but for some reason I had to hunt through the details to make out the bird - I for some reason didn''t see it right away.  It wasn''t until I saw your title that I realized the closed eyes, then it all came together.  The sweet little bird is very camouflaged.  I am not sure what you could do here to help direct the viewer''s eyes.  The OOF objects in the bottom right and top left are a little distracting from the photo.  But regardless of that - very cute subject and great detail!</td>', 'Very cute - but for some reason I had to hunt through the details to make out the bird - I for some reason didn''t see it right away.  It wasn''t until I saw your title that I realized the closed eyes, then it all came together.  The sweet little bird is very camouflaged.  I am not sure what you could do here to help direct the viewer''s eyes.  The OOF objects in the bottom right and top left are a little distracting from the photo.  But regardless of that - very cute subject and great detail!', '2009-06-02 00:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509391, 794893, 39057, '<td valign="top">No vote but a strong 7 from me.</td>', 'No vote but a strong 7 from me.', '2009-06-02 00:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509392, 791278, 57460, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the brilliant green eyes and beautiful use of DOF.  Great job!</td>', 'Great focus on the brilliant green eyes and beautiful use of DOF.  Great job!', '2009-06-02 00:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509395, 794918, 57460, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and color.  Great capture.  I love the pollen he is covered in.  Great job!</td>', 'Beautiful detail and color.  Great capture.  I love the pollen he is covered in.  Great job!', '2009-06-02 00:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509402, 795577, 57460, '<td valign="top">I love the simplistic aspect of this photo - it is very Zen feeling.  Beautiful blue sky too!  The bottom rock - I think the lighting on it distracts a little.  Maybe cropping it out, or burning it a bit to help keep the viewer looking from the tree, down the rocks, then back up the other side.  Otherwise the eye seems to go from the tree, down the rocks, then stays on that bottom rock - and the contrast between the shadow and the sky on frame right never gets explored.  I don''t know if that makes much sense - I am getting a little tired! : )  But I do love this shot!</td>', 'I love the simplistic aspect of this photo - it is very Zen feeling.  Beautiful blue sky too!  The bottom rock - I think the lighting on it distracts a little.  Maybe cropping it out, or burning it a bit to help keep the viewer looking from the tree, down the rocks, then back up the other side.  Otherwise the eye seems to go from the tree, down the rocks, then stays on that bottom rock - and the contrast between the shadow and the sky on frame right never gets explored.  I don''t know if that makes much sense - I am getting a little tired! : )  But I do love this shot!', '2009-06-02 00:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509404, 795623, 57460, '<td valign="top">I love the look on his face - your title fits it perfect.  I wish his face was a little more in focus.  Great shot though!</td>', 'I love the look on his face - your title fits it perfect.  I wish his face was a little more in focus.  Great shot though!', '2009-06-02 00:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509407, 794746, 57460, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and lovely pattern.  Though the main subject is the color and the pattern itself - it is still recognizable what it is which allows the viewers mind to fill in the rest of the imagery of the balloons.  Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and lovely pattern.  Though the main subject is the color and the pattern itself - it is still recognizable what it is which allows the viewers mind to fill in the rest of the imagery of the balloons.  Good job!', '2009-06-02 00:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
