(5512792, 791007, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the sky has been over exposed quite badly. My eye wanders up from the girl into that white space.  The eye always goes to the lightest part of a photo, use this to pull the viewers eye to where YOU want it to go.  Compose the image so the lighter areas are around the main focal object.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the sky has been over exposed quite badly. My eye wanders up from the girl into that white space.  The eye always goes to the lightest part of a photo, use this to pull the viewers eye to where YOU want it to go.  Compose the image so the lighter areas are around the main focal object.', '2009-06-03 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
