(5513825, 795502, 3149, '<td valign="top">It seems your white balance was set for artificial lighting.  Looks too blue for a green subject.  I think a few small curves and level adjustments would help as well.  Good Luck!</td>', 'It seems your white balance was set for artificial lighting.  Looks too blue for a green subject.  I think a few small curves and level adjustments would help as well.  Good Luck!', '2009-06-04 11:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
