(5514377, 791489, 68546, '<td valign="top">This is such a shame all the skin on the neck and the chest is completely blown out, I love the movement and the lighting in the hair but that''s quite a large area of skin to have no detail in at all. Great concept and timing, just a little work needed on the lighting or RAW conversion to maintain the details</td>', 'This is such a shame all the skin on the neck and the chest is completely blown out, I love the movement and the lighting in the hair but that''s quite a large area of skin to have no detail in at all. Great concept and timing, just a little work needed on the lighting or RAW conversion to maintain the details', '2009-06-04 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
