(5515397, 795512, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and the shiny, curled petals.  Bright contrasting colors are causing an optical illusion of a blue/purple outline around much of the flowers.  There''s a tiny bit of color fringing there but when I look at this magnified I can see that it appears more fringed than it is.  I''ve had that happen; don''t know a way around it other than decreasing saturation, but that won''t capture the vibrance of spring as well.</td>', 'Like the composition and the shiny, curled petals.  Bright contrasting colors are causing an optical illusion of a blue/purple outline around much of the flowers.  There''s a tiny bit of color fringing there but when I look at this magnified I can see that it appears more fringed than it is.  I''ve had that happen; don''t know a way around it other than decreasing saturation, but that won''t capture the vibrance of spring as well.', '2009-06-05 10:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5515403, 795113, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous Redhead, nice light, and wonderful golds and blues in the reflections.  I think I''d play with cropping it so his eye is on a rule of thirds and adjust light/contrast/sharpness to make him stand out just a bit better from the background.  Still, a shot I''d be thrilled to get :-)</td>', 'Gorgeous Redhead, nice light, and wonderful golds and blues in the reflections.  I think I''d play with cropping it so his eye is on a rule of thirds and adjust light/contrast/sharpness to make him stand out just a bit better from the background.  Still, a shot I''d be thrilled to get :-)', '2009-06-05 10:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
