(5515901, 791007, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice concept, but I think the lighting isn''t enhancing your subject and with the dominant overexposed sky area, they are getting lost, perhaps waiting until the shadows changed place and the sunlight hit your subject - or otherwise with this as is, maybe a conversion to sepia or b&amp;w may have given this a little extra.</td>', '4 - Nice concept, but I think the lighting isn''t enhancing your subject and with the dominant overexposed sky area, they are getting lost, perhaps waiting until the shadows changed place and the sunlight hit your subject - or otherwise with this as is, maybe a conversion to sepia or b&w may have given this a little extra.', '2009-06-05 17:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
