(5516130, 792540, 96901, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea... almost like mine this month.  I like the overall mood with it, but it''s odd that the rocks in the foreground are more warm than the rest of it--they kind of distract from balloons.</td>', 'Interesting idea... almost like mine this month.  I like the overall mood with it, but it''s odd that the rocks in the foreground are more warm than the rest of it--they kind of distract from balloons.', '2009-06-05 21:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516133, 795472, 96901, '<td valign="top">Amazing mood.  One thing I think I would fix is the cropping: I think you should have cropped the vent thing or whatever it is so that photo is more focused on the trees.</td>', 'Amazing mood.  One thing I think I would fix is the cropping: I think you should have cropped the vent thing or whatever it is so that photo is more focused on the trees.', '2009-06-05 21:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
