(5516135, 794968, 66041, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the depth of field is too narrow for me.   With everything behind her out of focus, it feels like she''s in front of a poster rather than in the actual location</td>', 'I like the concept, but the depth of field is too narrow for me.   With everything behind her out of focus, it feels like she''s in front of a poster rather than in the actual location', '2009-06-05 21:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
