(5516138, 794423, 66041, '<td valign="top">Personal opinion - I love the signs - very well done.   But the fact that I see people but they''re too dark is distracting.  I might have cropped a lot of the bottom off and made it a thin landscape shot of just the building-scape.</td>', 'Personal opinion - I love the signs - very well done.   But the fact that I see people but they''re too dark is distracting.  I might have cropped a lot of the bottom off and made it a thin landscape shot of just the building-scape.', '2009-06-05 21:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516140, 788047, 66041, '<td valign="top">For some reason I find his expression extremely compelling... Something''s on his mind, but you''re not quite sure what it is.  I like photos that make me thing  :)  This isn''t some wow-sunset photo, but it''s a technically grate photo (lighting color, etc), and you''ve captured the spirit of your subject.   A well earned 10.</td>', 'For some reason I find his expression extremely compelling... Something''s on his mind, but you''re not quite sure what it is.  I like photos that make me thing  :)  This isn''t some wow-sunset photo, but it''s a technically grate photo (lighting color, etc), and you''ve captured the spirit of your subject.   A well earned 10.', '2009-06-05 22:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
