(5517606, 792097, 80167, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Your frame on the image works well. I really like the bland sky with the atmospheric haze in the upper left. This composition is excellent as well. Lots of energy. GREAT SHOT!</td>', 'Beautiful! Your frame on the image works well. I really like the bland sky with the atmospheric haze in the upper left. This composition is excellent as well. Lots of energy. GREAT SHOT!', '2009-06-07 01:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517607, 795603, 80167, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground but your processing of the sky seems "dirty". You were obviously trying to convey the feel of the sunset, but the minimal contrast between clouds and sky bothers me. I like the composition, though!</td>', 'I like the foreground but your processing of the sky seems "dirty". You were obviously trying to convey the feel of the sunset, but the minimal contrast between clouds and sky bothers me. I like the composition, though!', '2009-06-07 01:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
