(5517611, 790935, 80167, '<td valign="top">Nice. The black background really helps the pelicans stand out. They are great subjects. On second thought, though, the black background is just so bland. I wish there was something more to put them in some context (in other words, are they in a zoo? next to a lake in a city? out in the wild? etc.).</td>', 'Nice. The black background really helps the pelicans stand out. They are great subjects. On second thought, though, the black background is just so bland. I wish there was something more to put them in some context (in other words, are they in a zoo? next to a lake in a city? out in the wild? etc.).', '2009-06-07 02:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517612, 795490, 80167, '<td valign="top">This picture is a little too sharp for my liking (even though my photos usually suffer from the same problem). It''s hard to make out the shapes of the birds as a result - especially the one in the upper left.</td>', 'This picture is a little too sharp for my liking (even though my photos usually suffer from the same problem). It''s hard to make out the shapes of the birds as a result - especially the one in the upper left.', '2009-06-07 02:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517613, 793471, 80167, '<td valign="top">Great selective desat! The girl''s pose is excellent as well! Your choice of crop is somewhat bland, IMHO, though. I might have liked the left vertical edge to be placed through the boy''s nose, leaving the left half of their expressions up to the imagination - but that''s just my artistic preference.</td>', 'Great selective desat! The girl''s pose is excellent as well! Your choice of crop is somewhat bland, IMHO, though. I might have liked the left vertical edge to be placed through the boy''s nose, leaving the left half of their expressions up to the imagination - but that''s just my artistic preference.', '2009-06-07 02:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517614, 791769, 45631, '<td valign="top">Whilst others may not like the processing done on this I do and I think it suits the subject well.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Whilst others may not like the processing done on this I do and I think it suits the subject well.  Nicely done.', '2009-06-07 02:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517616, 789178, 80167, '<td valign="top">This must have taken some time! I like it, but IMHO the water is too "violent" - in that the bubbles on the left side of the bottle keep there from being definition on the bottle. But, who knows, maybe that would look worse (probably, haha). Great shot!</td>', 'This must have taken some time! I like it, but IMHO the water is too "violent" - in that the bubbles on the left side of the bottle keep there from being definition on the bottle. But, who knows, maybe that would look worse (probably, haha). Great shot!', '2009-06-07 02:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517617, 792836, 80167, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness on the hair! I wish the crop was a little more interesting, though.</td>', 'Nice sharpness on the hair! I wish the crop was a little more interesting, though.', '2009-06-07 02:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517618, 794561, 80167, '<td valign="top">This is a very action filled shot! I had trouble making out a defined form for the dog in red. I have no idea why. The background seems a little weird with all of that spray being sharpened even though it''s somewhat in the bokeh.</td>', 'This is a very action filled shot! I had trouble making out a defined form for the dog in red. I have no idea why. The background seems a little weird with all of that spray being sharpened even though it''s somewhat in the bokeh.', '2009-06-07 02:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517619, 795084, 80167, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the soft feel of this shot! It''s so perfect. I wish the top of the castle was a little brighter to fit with the front side of it, but that''s minimal. The water looks very good!</td>', 'I absolutely love the soft feel of this shot! It''s so perfect. I wish the top of the castle was a little brighter to fit with the front side of it, but that''s minimal. The water looks very good!', '2009-06-07 02:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517620, 794691, 80167, '<td valign="top">Nice composition! I wish the bokeh had a little more interest in it, though. The circles are nice, though, haha.</td>', 'Nice composition! I wish the bokeh had a little more interest in it, though. The circles are nice, though, haha.', '2009-06-07 02:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517621, 795577, 80167, '<td valign="top">I like your composition here.</td>', 'I like your composition here.', '2009-06-07 02:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517622, 794895, 80167, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes, beautiful vignette - very fitting. I wish her face were just a tad brighter, though because the whole image feels a little dark.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes, beautiful vignette - very fitting. I wish her face were just a tad brighter, though because the whole image feels a little dark.', '2009-06-07 02:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517623, 791573, 80167, '<td valign="top">I love the story being told by this photo. Each character is in the middle of a dramatic action. This is great street photography that will probably go somewhat unnoticed. WELL DONE.</td>', 'I love the story being told by this photo. Each character is in the middle of a dramatic action. This is great street photography that will probably go somewhat unnoticed. WELL DONE.', '2009-06-07 02:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517625, 793691, 80167, '<td valign="top">Oh my! This is phenomenal. My favorite of the challenge so far. Wonderful composition, great expression, magic hour... I could go on and on. I love how the red cape stands out. Well done, well done!</td>', 'Oh my! This is phenomenal. My favorite of the challenge so far. Wonderful composition, great expression, magic hour... I could go on and on. I love how the red cape stands out. Well done, well done!', '2009-06-07 02:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517626, 795365, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice place but the centred horizon is a little bland...try the rule of thirds</td>', 'nice place but the centred horizon is a little bland...try the rule of thirds', '2009-06-07 02:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517627, 792551, 34938, '<td valign="top">this is stunning and magnificent...deserves a ribbon 9</td>', 'this is stunning and magnificent...deserves a ribbon 9', '2009-06-07 02:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517628, 792544, 80167, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! IMHO I don''t really like your moderate desaturation of the image, though. I would have preferred it all the way b/w - but that''s just me. This image is very powerful on its own - it doesn''t need the touch of color, IMHO.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! IMHO I don''t really like your moderate desaturation of the image, though. I would have preferred it all the way b/w - but that''s just me. This image is very powerful on its own - it doesn''t need the touch of color, IMHO.', '2009-06-07 02:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517629, 788047, 80167, '<td valign="top">Gerat shot! The glasses in his hand are a great touch - as is the upper vignette.</td>', 'Gerat shot! The glasses in his hand are a great touch - as is the upper vignette.', '2009-06-07 02:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517630, 793135, 34938, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the composition and crop don''t really work</td>', 'Interesting, but the composition and crop don''t really work', '2009-06-07 02:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
