(5517632, 794905, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow, what a beast! I reckon it could have been cropped a little tighter</td>', 'wow, what a beast! I reckon it could have been cropped a little tighter', '2009-06-07 02:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517633, 789429, 34938, '<td valign="top">great lighting and contrast...an excellent portrait</td>', 'great lighting and contrast...an excellent portrait', '2009-06-07 02:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517634, 792674, 80167, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I''m sure a lot of effort was put into this! Great focus - and the movement in the wings/tail is very good! I''m not a big fan of the green element of the frame, though. It doesn''t stand out well from the green background. And, being a big nitpicker, I just wish I could see the full wing in the lower left. NOT a big deal, though. GREAT WORK!</td>', 'Great shot! I''m sure a lot of effort was put into this! Great focus - and the movement in the wings/tail is very good! I''m not a big fan of the green element of the frame, though. It doesn''t stand out well from the green background. And, being a big nitpicker, I just wish I could see the full wing in the lower left. NOT a big deal, though. GREAT WORK!', '2009-06-07 02:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517635, 789228, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice interesting arty image, I like it 7</td>', 'nice interesting arty image, I like it 7', '2009-06-07 02:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517636, 792509, 34938, '<td valign="top">good, but overshaprened...composition is good</td>', 'good, but overshaprened...composition is good', '2009-06-07 02:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517637, 794913, 80167, '<td valign="top">Beautiful HDR. I''m normally not a big fan of the super-underexposed skies in HDRs, but this one really works in b/w. I really like how you''ve processed this image.</td>', 'Beautiful HDR. I''m normally not a big fan of the super-underexposed skies in HDRs, but this one really works in b/w. I really like how you''ve processed this image.', '2009-06-07 02:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
