(5518653, 789825, 18197, '<td valign="top">The beautiful contrast and largely B&amp;W presentation are wonderfully presented. Composition is superb. I love that it''s an out of the box entry ... creative! Among best in show.</td>', 'The beautiful contrast and largely B&W presentation are wonderfully presented. Composition is superb. I love that it''s an out of the box entry ... creative! Among best in show.', '2009-06-07 20:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
