(5518656, 794620, 18197, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''m a sucker for powerful jets, ... and for condensation over the control surfaces, ... and for unusual attitudes. I''m also a sucker for a well composed, shot, and presented photo. You''re 3 for 3 on that score. Well done!</td>', 'Okay, I''m a sucker for powerful jets, ... and for condensation over the control surfaces, ... and for unusual attitudes. I''m also a sucker for a well composed, shot, and presented photo. You''re 3 for 3 on that score. Well done!', '2009-06-07 20:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5518658, 794539, 18197, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W contributes substantially to the feeling of depth and texture here. Well done!</td>', 'B&W contributes substantially to the feeling of depth and texture here. Well done!', '2009-06-07 20:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5518663, 795084, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve been here and shot this landmark from many perspectives. But your photo is about the best I''ve seen of Eilean Donan. Thanks for the great photo ... and for the nostalgia trip.</td>', 'I''ve been here and shot this landmark from many perspectives. But your photo is about the best I''ve seen of Eilean Donan. Thanks for the great photo ... and for the nostalgia trip.', '2009-06-07 20:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5518667, 794871, 18197, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo. It always amazes me how a great photo captures the emotion and spirit of a subject as this does. The 1,000 yard stare helps of course. But so does the presentation. Well done!</td>', 'Terrific photo. It always amazes me how a great photo captures the emotion and spirit of a subject as this does. The 1,000 yard stare helps of course. But so does the presentation. Well done!', '2009-06-07 20:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5518669, 795103, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very Ansel Adams. Beautifully done!</td>', 'Very Ansel Adams. Beautifully done!', '2009-06-07 20:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5518680, 795552, 18197, '<td valign="top">The flower is beautiful and your capture of it is terrific. I know there''s been a lot of experimentation in the side challenges with overlays and borders. This one is well executed, but I can''t help but wonder if the photo would have been better with a border that grabbed less attention, competed less with the subject, and let the beauty of the subject carry it. I''m unsure about how I feel. Beautiful entry well captured and presented.</td>', 'The flower is beautiful and your capture of it is terrific. I know there''s been a lot of experimentation in the side challenges with overlays and borders. This one is well executed, but I can''t help but wonder if the photo would have been better with a border that grabbed less attention, competed less with the subject, and let the beauty of the subject carry it. I''m unsure about how I feel. Beautiful entry well captured and presented.', '2009-06-07 20:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5518701, 795070, 8367, '<td valign="top">Unique and postcard perfect! Love the tones.</td>', 'Unique and postcard perfect! Love the tones.', '2009-06-07 20:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
