(5519220, 794981, 65319, '<td valign="top">The detail of the foreground captures my eye immediately and the subtle yet compelling composition draws me back through the mountains, and into the distant horizon.  I could mediate on this photo for quite a while.  Well done, Mark!</td>', 'The detail of the foreground captures my eye immediately and the subtle yet compelling composition draws me back through the mountains, and into the distant horizon.  I could mediate on this photo for quite a while.  Well done, Mark!', '2009-06-08 01:14:38.000000', NULL, 0),
