(5519268, 794456, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think the ladies liked this one, Max.  :-)  OK, on a more serious note (and I must look away from the shot to be more serious), excellent lighting, great pose, and a very cool setting for this one.  Very nice work indeed!  And congrats on the new top row entry!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-06-08 14:31:16.</i></td>', 'I think the ladies liked this one, Max.  :-)  OK, on a more serious note (and I must look away from the shot to be more serious), excellent lighting, great pose, and a very cool setting for this one.  Very nice work indeed!  And congrats on the new top row entry!', '2009-06-08 01:28:20.000000', '2009-06-08 15:31:16.000000', 0),
