(5519337, 795569, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t me, I swear! :D<br/> <br/>As far as kitty shots go, this one is pretty cool. Given the clarity and sharpness of the eyes though, I would have been inclined to crop in really tight, eliminating the background and thereby moving the point of interest up to a more comfortable placement within the composition.</td>', 'Wasn''t me, I swear! :D As far as kitty shots go, this one is pretty cool. Given the clarity and sharpness of the eyes though, I would have been inclined to crop in really tight, eliminating the background and thereby moving the point of interest up to a more comfortable placement within the composition.', '2009-06-08 02:04:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519338, 792951, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  Nice ''innocence'' captured.  Maybe a more refined crop may have packed more punch...  Just the subtle distractions for me, including the enclosure in the background, take you away from the ''moment''.. if that makes sense.  Lovely focal points.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  Nice ''innocence'' captured.  Maybe a more refined crop may have packed more punch...  Just the subtle distractions for me, including the enclosure in the background, take you away from the ''moment''.. if that makes sense.  Lovely focal points.', '2009-06-08 02:06:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519339, 795569, 37252, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this challenge, but read your post in the threads. I think the big thing that hurts this is the blown highlights. Other than that it still lacks the wow that the higher scoring shots have.<br/> <br/>I do like the stalking walk of the kitty, and the intense look in the eyes. Just think the technicals needed work.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this challenge, but read your post in the threads. I think the big thing that hurts this is the blown highlights. Other than that it still lacks the wow that the higher scoring shots have. I do like the stalking walk of the kitty, and the intense look in the eyes. Just think the technicals needed work.', '2009-06-08 02:06:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519341, 791573, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t come up for me in voting, but I think I would have given it a good vote. Really conveys a story. The little girl with the want ads under her arm is the kicker part of this shot to me. Unfortunately, We know how street photography usually fares here.</td>', 'Didn''t come up for me in voting, but I think I would have given it a good vote. Really conveys a story. The little girl with the want ads under her arm is the kicker part of this shot to me. Unfortunately, We know how street photography usually fares here.', '2009-06-08 02:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
