(5519349, 792016, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t come up for me in voting, but I think I would have given it a good score. Didn''t do well because it is not a pretty and pleasing image. Conveys the title exceptionally well, however. Underrated, IMO.</td>', 'Didn''t come up for me in voting, but I think I would have given it a good score. Didn''t do well because it is not a pretty and pleasing image. Conveys the title exceptionally well, however. Underrated, IMO.', '2009-06-08 02:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
