(5519370, 794402, 37252, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>Positives: The extreme close up ensures the viewer will notice the rain drops and not just think "ok, another flower shot". The composition works well. I like the diagonal line my eye follows.<br/>You have captured the beautiful coloration of a deep purple that really catches the eye.<br/> <br/>Negatives: The lighter purple flower part in the upper left (stamnin ?) looks as if it was not in very good focus and you tried over sharpening it to correct that flaw. When I see a flower, I think of soft and dainty, not harsh like this. <br/> <br/>Looking closely at this image, the drops that I like the most are those that lie tangential to the flower petal. Perhaps shooting at a more tangential angle over all would have created an even more interesting point of view of the raindrops.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club Positives: The extreme close up ensures the viewer will notice the rain drops and not just think "ok, another flower shot". The composition works well. I like the diagonal line my eye follows.You have captured the beautiful coloration of a deep purple that really catches the eye. Negatives: The lighter purple flower part in the upper left (stamnin ?) looks as if it was not in very good focus and you tried over sharpening it to correct that flaw. When I see a flower, I think of soft and dainty, not harsh like this.  Looking closely at this image, the drops that I like the most are those that lie tangential to the flower petal. Perhaps shooting at a more tangential angle over all would have created an even more interesting point of view of the raindrops.', '2009-06-08 02:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519372, 795092, 90098, '<td valign="top">Seriously, who votes this as a 1?</td>', 'Seriously, who votes this as a 1?', '2009-06-08 02:31:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519373, 793946, 59267, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lighting and processing!! Should go higher.</td>', 'Great composition, lighting and processing!! Should go higher.', '2009-06-08 02:31:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519374, 795121, 73056, '<td valign="top">I think this turned out wonderful and so do the voters. Your experiment paid off!</td>', 'I think this turned out wonderful and so do the voters. Your experiment paid off!', '2009-06-08 02:32:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519376, 794679, 68504, '<td valign="top">Pure vision.  Agonizing and delightful.  It makes me think even more of how we see but do not see, how seeing is everything but we spurn it, believing some dang ding-an-sich (to be determined by "science" at some future date) is more important.  <br/> <br/>Of course you got the posthumous blue - you should have ALL his ribbons.  <br/> <br/>Love how this got moriadelacroix going.  Love your ones, twos and threes.  And I love the lichen blooms (if that is what they are) at the top of the picture that make the whole thing work.</td>', 'Pure vision.  Agonizing and delightful.  It makes me think even more of how we see but do not see, how seeing is everything but we spurn it, believing some dang ding-an-sich (to be determined by "science" at some future date) is more important.   Of course you got the posthumous blue - you should have ALL his ribbons.   Love how this got moriadelacroix going.  Love your ones, twos and threes.  And I love the lichen blooms (if that is what they are) at the top of the picture that make the whole thing work.', '2009-06-08 02:34:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519382, 792928, 3724, '<td valign="top">I like this intuitive edit.... displays a quiet, soft/muted quality - a curious opposite of the ferocity, concentration &amp; power of the intent of the descent.</td>', 'I like this intuitive edit.... displays a quiet, soft/muted quality - a curious opposite of the ferocity, concentration & power of the intent of the descent.', '2009-06-08 02:39:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519384, 790371, 59267, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!! A real windmill. Congratulations on your excellent photo and top 10!!</td>', 'Beautiful!! A real windmill. Congratulations on your excellent photo and top 10!!', '2009-06-08 02:41:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519385, 795645, 45475, '<td valign="top">Well it wasn''t much of a race since all our scores went the wrong way. But I think I still beat you all ;)<br/> <br/>Love the tones in this, striking and looks almost metallic. Congrats for the Posthumous yellow!</td>', 'Well it wasn''t much of a race since all our scores went the wrong way. But I think I still beat you all ;) Love the tones in this, striking and looks almost metallic. Congrats for the Posthumous yellow!', '2009-06-08 02:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519386, 795173, 3724, '<td valign="top">beautiful work.</td>', 'beautiful work.', '2009-06-08 02:42:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519388, 793773, 3724, '<td valign="top">gorgeous sky.</td>', 'gorgeous sky.', '2009-06-08 02:43:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5519389, 795377, 3724, '<td valign="top">coiled fern.... beautiful work - 9</td>', 'coiled fern.... beautiful work - 9', '2009-06-08 02:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
