(5520196, 794679, 57460, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pointandshoot:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> Love how this got moriadelacroix going.   </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I agree. Her comment was one of my all time favorites. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am glad to hear you enjoyed my comment  as long and chaotic as it may have been.  I still cant find the words to say exactly what it is about your photo - but it just gripped me in the depths of my spine  not like an agonizing pain would, but like a deep unidentifiable emotion  like feeling an emotion for the first time, and at the same time having all senses burned with every emotion all at once.  It holds such captivating symbolism with such a simple three object photo.  Maybe it was just the matching photo for the incomplete puzzle of my life at the time  but I still think it is more than just that  as I am sure I am not the only one moved by your photo (though I may have been the more chaotically expressed one!).  You well deserve the posthumous blue ribbon.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Originally posted by pointandshoot: Originally posted by tnun: Love how this got moriadelacroix going.    I agree. Her comment was one of my all time favorites.   I am glad to hear you enjoyed my comment  as long and chaotic as it may have been.  I still cant find the words to say exactly what it is about your photo - but it just gripped me in the depths of my spine  not like an agonizing pain would, but like a deep unidentifiable emotion  like feeling an emotion for the first time, and at the same time having all senses burned with every emotion all at once.  It holds such captivating symbolism with such a simple three object photo.  Maybe it was just the matching photo for the incomplete puzzle of my life at the time  but I still think it is more than just that  as I am sure I am not the only one moved by your photo (though I may have been the more chaotically expressed one!).  You well deserve the posthumous blue ribbon.  Congratulations!', '2009-06-08 15:19:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520199, 791573, 88523, '<td valign="top">Great great shot! I like it that each member is concentrating on something the others aren''t!</td>', 'Great great shot! I like it that each member is concentrating on something the others aren''t!', '2009-06-08 15:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520216, 792580, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, very touching, especially given the title.  I seem to recall you posted these little guys earlier when they were first born.  Now they''re ready to go their own way, I see.  I love how you posed them with the ones that look alike mostly together.  And huge congrats on getting them all to sit so nicely for you!  An excellent family portrait - one you''ll keep and cherish, I''m sure.</td>', 'Very sweet, very touching, especially given the title.  I seem to recall you posted these little guys earlier when they were first born.  Now they''re ready to go their own way, I see.  I love how you posed them with the ones that look alike mostly together.  And huge congrats on getting them all to sit so nicely for you!  An excellent family portrait - one you''ll keep and cherish, I''m sure.', '2009-06-08 15:33:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520217, 794498, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sad, but really good.</td>', 'Sad, but really good.', '2009-06-08 15:33:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520221, 794928, 30982, '<td valign="top">Woefully underrated, and most unfortunately, it''s probably because some folks don''t like the border.  I thought this a lovely use of high key - has a great sense of serenity to it, the water is lovely, and even though it''s high key, the sky is clean, not blown.  Really lovely work - delicate touch, and very much underappreciated.</td>', 'Woefully underrated, and most unfortunately, it''s probably because some folks don''t like the border.  I thought this a lovely use of high key - has a great sense of serenity to it, the water is lovely, and even though it''s high key, the sky is clean, not blown.  Really lovely work - delicate touch, and very much underappreciated.', '2009-06-08 15:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520224, 795472, 30982, '<td valign="top">You already know I like this.  :-)</td>', 'You already know I like this.  :-)', '2009-06-08 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520225, 792928, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent action capture - the bird is so intent, so focused, and you caught that very well!  I especially like the talons - looks as though he''s preparing to strike.</td>', 'Excellent action capture - the bird is so intent, so focused, and you caught that very well!  I especially like the talons - looks as though he''s preparing to strike.', '2009-06-08 15:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520228, 795201, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very elegant, good exposure control, very crisp and clean detail on the feathers, and you''ve gotta love that regal pose!  I can see just a wee bit of splotchy in the background - in my experience results from converting an ultra blue sky to B&amp;W (and I''ve no good advice on how to avoid that).</td>', 'Very elegant, good exposure control, very crisp and clean detail on the feathers, and you''ve gotta love that regal pose!  I can see just a wee bit of splotchy in the background - in my experience results from converting an ultra blue sky to B&W (and I''ve no good advice on how to avoid that).', '2009-06-08 15:40:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520231, 792368, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bright and colorful and good detail.  The composition is just a bit static.  Though I''m sure your objective was to give us a good clear look at the clock and cardinal detail (which this does!) I''m the kind of person who likes a bit more context.  Not sure if that would work with this because I have to admit I''ve never been there.</td>', 'Bright and colorful and good detail.  The composition is just a bit static.  Though I''m sure your objective was to give us a good clear look at the clock and cardinal detail (which this does!) I''m the kind of person who likes a bit more context.  Not sure if that would work with this because I have to admit I''ve never been there.', '2009-06-08 15:42:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520232, 788943, 98022, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on an awesome photo and an oustanding debut on DPC. Welcome! I look forward to many more great photos. <br/></td>', 'Congratulations on an awesome photo and an oustanding debut on DPC. Welcome! I look forward to many more great photos. ', '2009-06-08 15:43:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520233, 795111, 30982, '<td valign="top">Deliberate and very well done.  A soothing respite from a busy day.</td>', 'Deliberate and very well done.  A soothing respite from a busy day.', '2009-06-08 15:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520234, 794561, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ve very pleased this did well!  You REALLY captured the action well here, from the flying sand to the intensity in the dogs'' eyes and their varying strides which show such power.  Excellent image, well edited, and congrats on a new top row entry!</td>', 'I''ve very pleased this did well!  You REALLY captured the action well here, from the flying sand to the intensity in the dogs'' eyes and their varying strides which show such power.  Excellent image, well edited, and congrats on a new top row entry!', '2009-06-08 15:45:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520239, 790799, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful and really sweet control of the light.  It beckons you to wander out there, sit a spell, and just take it all in.  And it really is a lovely edit - strikingly so when compared to the similar one for furniture.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-06-08 14:47:41.</i></td>', 'Very peaceful and really sweet control of the light.  It beckons you to wander out there, sit a spell, and just take it all in.  And it really is a lovely edit - strikingly so when compared to the similar one for furniture.', '2009-06-08 15:47:02.000000', '2009-06-08 15:47:41.000000', 0),
(5520244, 795553, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nick would be pleased.  You''ve captured the sun quietly painting while it thinks no one is watching.  Very interesting methodology - I suspect Joe Dannels uses a similar approach as far as exposure.</td>', 'Nick would be pleased.  You''ve captured the sun quietly painting while it thinks no one is watching.  Very interesting methodology - I suspect Joe Dannels uses a similar approach as far as exposure.', '2009-06-08 15:49:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520246, 794402, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the echoed patterns formed in the waterdrops - I see birds, deer, butterflies in there.  Really quite fascinating!</td>', 'I like the echoed patterns formed in the waterdrops - I see birds, deer, butterflies in there.  Really quite fascinating!', '2009-06-08 15:51:10.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5520247, 794689, 30982, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of an orchestra, ready to play.  I''m not sure why I think that, but I can even hear it!  Lovely work, Shez.</td>', 'This makes me think of an orchestra, ready to play.  I''m not sure why I think that, but I can even hear it!  Lovely work, Shez.', '2009-06-08 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520248, 789699, 30982, '<td valign="top">I remember this one - I viewed this more than once and for awhile each time.  As I said in my comment during the challenge, there''s a lovely poignency to this - a very personal glimpse into the everyday.</td>', 'I remember this one - I viewed this more than once and for awhile each time.  As I said in my comment during the challenge, there''s a lovely poignency to this - a very personal glimpse into the everyday.', '2009-06-08 15:52:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520249, 790371, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image. Really superb. Congrats on 7th place, Keith.</td>', 'Gorgeous image. Really superb. Congrats on 7th place, Keith.', '2009-06-08 15:53:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520250, 792264, 30982, '<td valign="top">How funny - I''ve never heard them called that!  Score isn''t what I would have expected, but it did break 5.  I quite like the vibrance of it.  Very clean and crisp, color is excellent.</td>', 'How funny - I''ve never heard them called that!  Score isn''t what I would have expected, but it did break 5.  I quite like the vibrance of it.  Very clean and crisp, color is excellent.', '2009-06-08 15:54:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520251, 791877, 52549, '<td valign="top">Amazing and totally beautiful. Congrats on top 10, Marion.</td>', 'Amazing and totally beautiful. Congrats on top 10, Marion.', '2009-06-08 15:54:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520252, 793989, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good composition with the use of foreground objects and the stream flowing (literally!) through the picture.  I would have expected this to score above a 5.  I think perhaps a more dynamic composition with the head of the stream less centered, and a bit softer light would add to this.  I''ve seen glacier water that green - but I wonder if some think it''s oddly colored in post processing?  I''d hope not!</td>', 'Good composition with the use of foreground objects and the stream flowing (literally!) through the picture.  I would have expected this to score above a 5.  I think perhaps a more dynamic composition with the head of the stream less centered, and a bit softer light would add to this.  I''ve seen glacier water that green - but I wonder if some think it''s oddly colored in post processing?  I''d hope not!', '2009-06-08 15:56:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520255, 795638, 30982, '<td valign="top">Krnodil-esque with a hint of undieyatch, or possibly verse vica - either way, a wonderful brew!</td>', 'Krnodil-esque with a hint of undieyatch, or possibly verse vica - either way, a wonderful brew!', '2009-06-08 15:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520256, 795465, 30982, '<td valign="top">Besides the supporting cast and the chocolate on her face, there''s the whole folded, distorted woman-on-the-tshirt thing going on which is awesome!  Really very fun, very enjoyable and one that made me smile during voting (and now as well!)</td>', 'Besides the supporting cast and the chocolate on her face, there''s the whole folded, distorted woman-on-the-tshirt thing going on which is awesome!  Really very fun, very enjoyable and one that made me smile during voting (and now as well!)', '2009-06-08 15:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520259, 792836, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love how serious he looks!  I think these guys are adorable.  And fascinating.  Good job blurring the background and getting good detail on the critter!</td>', 'I love how serious he looks!  I think these guys are adorable.  And fascinating.  Good job blurring the background and getting good detail on the critter!', '2009-06-08 16:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520260, 795623, 30982, '<td valign="top">WOEFULLY underappreciated.  I love this guy''s look!  Colors are rich, composition is good, and I love that wee flower in the front that is about to get totally stomped.</td>', 'WOEFULLY underappreciated.  I love this guy''s look!  Colors are rich, composition is good, and I love that wee flower in the front that is about to get totally stomped.', '2009-06-08 16:01:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520264, 792827, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quiet, elegant, and a lovely presentation.  Great detail and color, and the bloom itself is exquisite.  Nice work with the processing - your soft touch with it makes it very clean, very natural.</td>', 'Quiet, elegant, and a lovely presentation.  Great detail and color, and the bloom itself is exquisite.  Nice work with the processing - your soft touch with it makes it very clean, very natural.', '2009-06-08 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520270, 794539, 1024, '<td valign="top">This looks like the workings insider an old watch from the thumbnail.  This is just wonderful!  Added to favs.</td>', 'This looks like the workings insider an old watch from the thumbnail.  This is just wonderful!  Added to favs.', '2009-06-08 16:07:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520271, 789228, 30982, '<td valign="top">This one made me stop and visit for awhile.  And seeing it again, I really should have known it was yours.  It has your feel to it.  In fact, I think within your portfolio you have several shots that would go together very well in an exhibit.</td>', 'This one made me stop and visit for awhile.  And seeing it again, I really should have known it was yours.  It has your feel to it.  In fact, I think within your portfolio you have several shots that would go together very well in an exhibit.', '2009-06-08 16:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520275, 791951, 30982, '<td valign="top">You already know I like this little guy - are you going to post some of your others?  You''d mentioned in a thread somewhere that you saw a problem in processing, but I''m not quite sure what that is.  I am rather surprised at the score - I really thought it would do much better than this.</td>', 'You already know I like this little guy - are you going to post some of your others?  You''d mentioned in a thread somewhere that you saw a problem in processing, but I''m not quite sure what that is.  I am rather surprised at the score - I really thought it would do much better than this.', '2009-06-08 16:08:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520279, 794523, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m quite surprised this didn''t score in the 6s.  The detail in the drops and especially in the veins in the petals is amazing.  Almost three dimensional - one can nearly reach out and touch the thing!</td>', 'I''m quite surprised this didn''t score in the 6s.  The detail in the drops and especially in the veins in the petals is amazing.  Almost three dimensional - one can nearly reach out and touch the thing!', '2009-06-08 16:09:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520284, 795073, 30982, '<td valign="top">It looks as though it''s been hand polished - the copper color stands out beautifully against the blue, and to me the workmanship is both gorgeous and fascinating.</td>', 'It looks as though it''s been hand polished - the copper color stands out beautifully against the blue, and to me the workmanship is both gorgeous and fascinating.', '2009-06-08 16:10:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520292, 795197, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this that made me pause during voting.  The not-quite-symmetry, for one thing; the table, just sorta there; but mostly the "world" in the next room, created in part by the peeling paint, in part by the blue light (the ocean, if you will).  Now having read the link you provided, all of this takes on even more significance.  The sheltered select few in their pristine white room, the world beyond in it''s peeling and rich glory.  Fascinating photograph.</td>', 'There''s something about this that made me pause during voting.  The not-quite-symmetry, for one thing; the table, just sorta there; but mostly the "world" in the next room, created in part by the peeling paint, in part by the blue light (the ocean, if you will).  Now having read the link you provided, all of this takes on even more significance.  The sheltered select few in their pristine white room, the world beyond in it''s peeling and rich glory.  Fascinating photograph.', '2009-06-08 16:14:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520314, 791951, 11854, '<td valign="top">I adored this and gave you a 9 in voting! I''m shocked this didn''t come in over 6. Maybe you should have titled it "Ta-Da" as it looks as if he''s doing a trick!</td>', 'I adored this and gave you a 9 in voting! I''m shocked this didn''t come in over 6. Maybe you should have titled it "Ta-Da" as it looks as if he''s doing a trick!', '2009-06-08 16:24:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520317, 794521, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really fun and sweet!  The driver looks like the actor Wilford Brimley (had to look that one up) and the two young men look like they could be his grandsons.  Great work with the light and tones.  And just noticed it''s a perfect 6.0000!</td>', 'Really fun and sweet!  The driver looks like the actor Wilford Brimley (had to look that one up) and the two young men look like they could be his grandsons.  Great work with the light and tones.  And just noticed it''s a perfect 6.0000!', '2009-06-08 16:26:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520320, 791207, 30982, '<td valign="top">No, it didn''t need to be cropped.  It''s quite lovely just the way it is!</td>', 'No, it didn''t need to be cropped.  It''s quite lovely just the way it is!', '2009-06-08 16:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520324, 793535, 30982, '<td valign="top">I agree, this should have done better!  The colors are magnificent and I like the geometrics in the bokeh.  I suspect the color noise (probably Topaz-induced) may have hurt the score a bit, but pshaw on the score - this is a beautiful shot!</td>', 'I agree, this should have done better!  The colors are magnificent and I like the geometrics in the bokeh.  I suspect the color noise (probably Topaz-induced) may have hurt the score a bit, but pshaw on the score - this is a beautiful shot!', '2009-06-08 16:29:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520329, 790902, 30982, '<td valign="top">This really does have an "end of the world" or more specifically EDGE of the world feel to it, as though what is beyond is something we haven''t seen before, and those four are about to find out.</td>', 'This really does have an "end of the world" or more specifically EDGE of the world feel to it, as though what is beyond is something we haven''t seen before, and those four are about to find out.', '2009-06-08 16:30:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520332, 794809, 30982, '<td valign="top">A ha!  So that''s what it is!  I spent some time trying to figure it out.  It''s almost planetary in nature - a bit of a universe in formation.</td>', 'A ha!  So that''s what it is!  I spent some time trying to figure it out.  It''s almost planetary in nature - a bit of a universe in formation.', '2009-06-08 16:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520360, 795552, 11854, '<td valign="top">And this is fabulous! I was one of your 10''s!</td>', 'And this is fabulous! I was one of your 10''s!', '2009-06-08 16:54:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520387, 795093, 33535, '<td valign="top">AH, nice view of Seljalandsfoss! Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'AH, nice view of Seljalandsfoss! Congrats on the ribbon!', '2009-06-08 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520390, 788943, 11078, '<td valign="top">I love your image<br/>Congratulations fabulous work</td>', 'I love your imageCongratulations fabulous work', '2009-06-08 17:16:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520410, 788943, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Blue Ribbon, what a way to start out. :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your Blue Ribbon, what a way to start out. :)', '2009-06-08 17:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520423, 794893, 16912, '<td valign="top">I''m suprised no commenters ''bumped'' this up T! I really like this shot and like Rina think it was a creative composition with just enough of the ''Talj'' negative space. I didn''t vote but would have started with at least a 6.</td>', 'I''m suprised no commenters ''bumped'' this up T! I really like this shot and like Rina think it was a creative composition with just enough of the ''Talj'' negative space. I didn''t vote but would have started with at least a 6.', '2009-06-08 17:47:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520454, 795121, 16912, '<td valign="top">nice one Sarah! the (non) bell curve says it all girl ;)</td>', 'nice one Sarah! the (non) bell curve says it all girl ;)', '2009-06-08 18:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520456, 795092, 80058, '<td valign="top">Pretty amazing!!! WOWWWW</td>', 'Pretty amazing!!! WOWWWW', '2009-06-08 18:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520461, 795121, 30982, '<td valign="top">YAY!  :-)</td>', 'YAY!  :-)', '2009-06-08 18:16:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520466, 794539, 16912, '<td valign="top">Too ''in focus'' and no pigeons, what were you thinking Deb?</td>', 'Too ''in focus'' and no pigeons, what were you thinking Deb?', '2009-06-08 18:22:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520506, 794913, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a strong HDR effect applied without all of the sloppiness that I see all too often in other people''s work.</td>', 'Nice to see a strong HDR effect applied without all of the sloppiness that I see all too often in other people''s work.', '2009-06-08 19:01:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520508, 792580, 31664, '<td valign="top">Vlado,  great shot,  I don''t know how you managed to get them all together like that!  Again we finish within a whisker of each other,  keeping our FSM rivalry close!</td>', 'Vlado,  great shot,  I don''t know how you managed to get them all together like that!  Again we finish within a whisker of each other,  keeping our FSM rivalry close!', '2009-06-08 19:03:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520510, 794620, 47294, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, congrats on your top 20!</td>', 'Excellent capture, congrats on your top 20!', '2009-06-08 19:05:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520514, 793479, 49018, '<td valign="top">Impressive :)<br/>Very nice use of wide-angle distortion!</td>', 'Impressive :)Very nice use of wide-angle distortion!', '2009-06-08 19:11:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520562, 794689, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow, you entered! Lovely to see! Hope this marks an upswing in your health situation :-)</td>', 'Wow, you entered! Lovely to see! Hope this marks an upswing in your health situation :-)', '2009-06-08 20:06:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520592, 788943, 37444, '<td valign="top">Congrats on this winning entry?<br/>Um, where can I get a frog like this LOL</td>', 'Congrats on this winning entry?Um, where can I get a frog like this LOL', '2009-06-08 20:38:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520593, 795092, 37444, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Stunning image. Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon!', '2009-06-08 20:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520594, 795093, 37444, '<td valign="top">Like the muted sky. Good choice.<br/>Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'Like the muted sky. Good choice.Congrats on your ribbon!', '2009-06-08 20:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520596, 794602, 37444, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!</td>', 'Beautifully done!', '2009-06-08 20:40:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520597, 795084, 37444, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job!</td>', 'Fantastic job!', '2009-06-08 20:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520635, 795023, 20608, '<td valign="top">5.7 is ridiculous</td>', '5.7 is ridiculous', '2009-06-08 21:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520649, 794401, 50695, '<td valign="top">another technical coup from you. I''m impressed.</td>', 'another technical coup from you. I''m impressed.', '2009-06-08 21:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520655, 794401, 86447, '<td valign="top">Seven in a FS is very hard to get.  Actually, seven in ANY challenge is quite a ''challenge'' to get.<br/> <br/>This is good.  And interesting.  I like the ears heart.   <br/> <br/>But, competing with FS entries will always be tougher than the usual competition.    :)<br/> <br/>It''s good and sharp, amazingly so for ''two'' shots.  Congrats on a fine FS score!</td>', 'Seven in a FS is very hard to get.  Actually, seven in ANY challenge is quite a ''challenge'' to get. This is good.  And interesting.  I like the ears heart.    But, competing with FS entries will always be tougher than the usual competition.    :) It''s good and sharp, amazingly so for ''two'' shots.  Congrats on a fine FS score!', '2009-06-08 21:30:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520671, 794903, 68504, '<td valign="top">Ah, Peewee Ladybug.  That one leg is eloquent.</td>', 'Ah, Peewee Ladybug.  That one leg is eloquent.', '2009-06-08 21:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520680, 794401, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like it.  I am a little jaded by the strange way free studies are judged so much more brutally than other challenges.  This photo and its score just further confirms my unhappy heart about the matter.  It''s like they are conditioned for those knock-your-socks-off Icelandic or Pacific Coast land/sea scapes, or a Middle Eastern portrait -- and anything else is darn sure going to pay.   I''m sorry you "paid".  It is an amazing technique pulled off to perfection!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really like it.  I am a little jaded by the strange way free studies are judged so much more brutally than other challenges.  This photo and its score just further confirms my unhappy heart about the matter.  It''s like they are conditioned for those knock-your-socks-off Icelandic or Pacific Coast land/sea scapes, or a Middle Eastern portrait -- and anything else is darn sure going to pay.   I''m sorry you "paid".  It is an amazing technique pulled off to perfection! ', '2009-06-08 21:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
