(5520871, 791093, 79955, '<td valign="top">Am really glad this did really well. A really marvellous shot. As I mentioned before the flash is a tad too obvious. One recommendation if you are using Photoshop CS is to use selective color (go to the white channel as a starting point) and subtlely adjust the warmer tones like yellow, red, magenta to get a warmer image.</td>', 'Am really glad this did really well. A really marvellous shot. As I mentioned before the flash is a tad too obvious. One recommendation if you are using Photoshop CS is to use selective color (go to the white channel as a starting point) and subtlely adjust the warmer tones like yellow, red, magenta to get a warmer image.', '2009-06-09 00:55:49.000000', NULL, 0),
