(5520880, 795374, 79955, '<td valign="top">Ernie, the score does not go with the quality of the shot for sure. Tack sharp and obviously you had great technique (great timing, wonderful focus , excellent tracking of the action, etc....) to capture the shot. It is very unfortunate that a lot of DPC voters do not really take into account the degree of difficulty that goes into capturing the shot.<br/> <br/>My only input would have been to crop away the house , just leaving the trees.</td>', 'Ernie, the score does not go with the quality of the shot for sure. Tack sharp and obviously you had great technique (great timing, wonderful focus , excellent tracking of the action, etc....) to capture the shot. It is very unfortunate that a lot of DPC voters do not really take into account the degree of difficulty that goes into capturing the shot. My only input would have been to crop away the house , just leaving the trees.', '2009-06-09 01:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
