(5521892, 795502, 66041, '<td valign="top">I think hotpasta hit the nail on the head.   This site has become more about "wow factor" than it has about photography.  This is a pretty good photo.   Yet I look at the other photos that got better than me (pretty much all the photos) and there are a lot of really bad photos that did better.   I think I just don''t know what criteria people use when they vote.   <br/> <br/>Edward - the green was a tough call.   Broccolli doesn''t look ''store green'' in the garden.   But less blue than this.  Playign with the colors though always made it seemed fake green, so I decided against trying to liven it up...</td>', 'I think hotpasta hit the nail on the head.   This site has become more about "wow factor" than it has about photography.  This is a pretty good photo.   Yet I look at the other photos that got better than me (pretty much all the photos) and there are a lot of really bad photos that did better.   I think I just don''t know what criteria people use when they vote.    Edward - the green was a tough call.   Broccolli doesn''t look ''store green'' in the garden.   But less blue than this.  Playign with the colors though always made it seemed fake green, so I decided against trying to liven it up...', '2009-06-09 23:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
