(5522845, 795658, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>Very surprised to find this score below 6. I like this image very much, the subject is interesting.  The tones and colours are excellent.<br/> <br/>The only thing I may consider changing a little bit is the crop.  I personally find the foreground rocks to be a bit redundant.  I think the image would be stronger if you cropped those out.<br/> <br/>Judging by the comments you have received, I think the border possibly hurt the score a bit.<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club Very surprised to find this score below 6. I like this image very much, the subject is interesting.  The tones and colours are excellent. The only thing I may consider changing a little bit is the crop.  I personally find the foreground rocks to be a bit redundant.  I think the image would be stronger if you cropped those out. Judging by the comments you have received, I think the border possibly hurt the score a bit.', '2009-06-10 14:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
