(5522956, 794015, 47470, '<td valign="top">No you are not allowed to create composites of two or more images.  The only time you can use more than one image is when you are taking long exposures (as in taking 10 30-second images instead of 1 5-minute image).  Even if you hadn''t put the watermark, you would have been DQ''d because of the composite.  Both images are very nice, but putting them together is illegal under this rule set.<br/> <br/>Hope to see more of your work!</td>', 'No you are not allowed to create composites of two or more images.  The only time you can use more than one image is when you are taking long exposures (as in taking 10 30-second images instead of 1 5-minute image).  Even if you hadn''t put the watermark, you would have been DQ''d because of the composite.  Both images are very nice, but putting them together is illegal under this rule set. Hope to see more of your work!', '2009-06-10 16:12:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5522973, 791859, 18197, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chromeydome:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>superb!  wonderful image, composition, colors, tones. A favorite of mine in the challenge without realizing you used an iPhone--so that is just extra amazing </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks, I''m honored!</td>', 'Originally posted by chromeydome: PostLuminous Award Nominee!superb!  wonderful image, composition, colors, tones. A favorite of mine in the challenge without realizing you used an iPhone--so that is just extra amazing  Thanks, I''m honored!', '2009-06-10 16:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
