(5523380, 795092, 39560, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photo. What I really like is the fact it was taken with an old out-dated(by DSLR standards today) 8mp Canon 20D. No offense intended. I just find it humorous especially on a site where people tend to go overboard looking for new technology to save/improve their photography instead of learning to master the old technology and the skills required to take a superb photo. IMO this is just as good as anything that could be taken with a 21mp 5D MKII if not better. Great timing, capture and PP.</td>', 'Outstanding photo. What I really like is the fact it was taken with an old out-dated(by DSLR standards today) 8mp Canon 20D. No offense intended. I just find it humorous especially on a site where people tend to go overboard looking for new technology to save/improve their photography instead of learning to master the old technology and the skills required to take a superb photo. IMO this is just as good as anything that could be taken with a 21mp 5D MKII if not better. Great timing, capture and PP.', '2009-06-10 22:33:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5523429, 794871, 18197, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chromeydome:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>beautiful conversion/treatment, and great capture of emotion </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well deserved!</td>', 'Originally posted by chromeydome: PostLuminous Award Nominee!beautiful conversion/treatment, and great capture of emotion   Well deserved!', '2009-06-10 23:35:10.000000', NULL, 0),
