(5550785, 794672, 54645, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by moriadelacroix:</b></div><hr/><i> I am not sure what you could do here to help direct the viewer''s eyes.  The OOF objects in the bottom right and top left are a little distracting from the photo.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Funny, I went straight to the bird! IMO, the DOF works quite well, except that the area just below the beak is quite bright, and maybe that''s why it was found "distracting".</td>', 'Originally posted by moriadelacroix: I am not sure what you could do here to help direct the viewer''s eyes.  The OOF objects in the bottom right and top left are a little distracting from the photo.  Funny, I went straight to the bird! IMO, the DOF works quite well, except that the area just below the beak is quite bright, and maybe that''s why it was found "distracting".', '2009-06-30 09:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
