(5561098, 794015, 3102, '<td valign="top">No, you''re not allowed to do that.  Replacing the background is a big no-no, in addition to the watermark.  Your entry must come from a single capture.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Digital_Susie:</b></div><hr/><i> I told them that, I got dq''d because of the watermark not putting in the background, your allowed to do that. </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-05 23:58:28.</i></td>', 'No, you''re not allowed to do that.  Replacing the background is a big no-no, in addition to the watermark.  Your entry must come from a single capture. Originally posted by Digital_Susie: I told them that, I got dq''d because of the watermark not putting in the background, your allowed to do that. ', '2009-07-06 00:58:01.000000', '2009-07-06 00:58:28.000000', 0),
