(5653868, 795074, 64568, '<td valign="top">I know commentors said this is way to sharpe, but know when I re-look at this shot,  it is the way "love" between 13/14 years old is, very robust, intense, first love etc etc..and I know I could have the lighting better,with better equipment (I have no flashes of reflectors etc), but I really think the sharpness of this represents the intense feelings kids have for each other when they are this age...maybe cliche, but when you think about when you was this young with your first love, it is exactly how it was..and it is only now that I realise this, not when I took the shot, so I find that quite interesting, when you look at a shot a few weeks/months later, interperate the comments and shot itself and read something totally different from what you was at first trying to achieve.</td>', 'I know commentors said this is way to sharpe, but know when I re-look at this shot,  it is the way "love" between 13/14 years old is, very robust, intense, first love etc etc..and I know I could have the lighting better,with better equipment (I have no flashes of reflectors etc), but I really think the sharpness of this represents the intense feelings kids have for each other when they are this age...maybe cliche, but when you think about when you was this young with your first love, it is exactly how it was..and it is only now that I realise this, not when I took the shot, so I find that quite interesting, when you look at a shot a few weeks/months later, interperate the comments and shot itself and read something totally different from what you was at first trying to achieve.', '2009-09-19 18:46:36.000000', NULL, 0),
