(5691366, 790935, 106733, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by briantammy:</b></div><hr/><i> amazing birds.  is this close to natural or heavily post proc. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry it''s taken me so long to post a reply I only use the site occasionally.<br/> <br/>The PP on this was largely contrast and a bit of saturation.  The colors are a result of a 20-30% increase in saturation and a bit of vibrancy.  I didn''t layer, mask or even dodge/burn this photo.<br/> <br/>The main reason I did so little is because I had no idea how to do those things on my software prior to posting this shot ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by briantammy: amazing birds.  is this close to natural or heavily post proc.   Sorry it''s taken me so long to post a reply I only use the site occasionally. The PP on this was largely contrast and a bit of saturation.  The colors are a result of a 20-30% increase in saturation and a bit of vibrancy.  I didn''t layer, mask or even dodge/burn this photo. The main reason I did so little is because I had no idea how to do those things on my software prior to posting this shot ;-)', '2009-10-18 17:27:01.000000', NULL, 0),
